{"id": "EUVD-2026-103078", "enisaUuid": "4e49924d-ccd2-390d-adbd-c0a2cd1d2810", "description": "ChatWiki through 2.9.6 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated users to access another tenant's form filters by supplying arbitrary form_id values. Attackers can send sequential form_id values to getFormFilterList, getFormFilterInfo and updateFormFilterSort to read filter rules and overwrite another tenant's filter sort order.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:18:25", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/chatwiki-form-filter-cross-tenant-idor", "https://github.com/zhimaAi/chatwiki/blob/v2.9.6/internal/app/chatwiki/business/manage/form.go#L878-L990", "https://github.com/zhimaAi/chatwiki/blob/v2.9.6/internal/app/chatwiki/business/manage/form.go#L1192-L1242", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/chatwiki-through-2.9.6-cross-tenant-idor-via-form-filter-management-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111656", "GHSA-wqfw-mf45-5858"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b10b8d23-3a09-3c0c-b01d-432c8a2884d0", "product": {"name": "chatwiki", "vendor": {"name": "zhimaAi"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.9.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f24cfd0d-eb2a-3fb6-9276-19f352f0e36f", "vendor": {"name": "zhimaAi"}}], "isExploited": false}